  ('611c0c89-3de3-5b82-88f7-561b46629683', 'reading', 'purpose', 1, 'mcq', 'The passage explains how to apply for a passport. What is the primary purpose of the passage?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('61f30f46-3052-54f3-b3bd-9f91b232c008', 'reading', 'structure', 2, 'mcq', 'The paragraph lists causes of pollution and then describes effects. Which structure does this use?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('17c6181d-693d-5fdb-a3de-c33b6e25c97b', 'reading', 'vocabulary', 1, 'mcq', 'The audience was captivated by the performance. What does captivated mean?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('b58b45b6-f92e-530f-a978-6043ffcbfd70', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'After the rain stopped, the streets glistened. What can be inferred?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('67e5f739-cdd6-5d17-b79a-414bfb7ed7e6', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'The new policy reduces waste by encouraging recycling and reuse. Which choice best states the main idea?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('0a65bb9b-e476-5a0a-b116-2607f2e29ebe', 'reading', 'grammar', 1, 'mcq', 'Neither of the answers are correct. Which change corrects the error?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('e48fec5c-1bc4-5b03-a27f-4f6e9a95b6e5', 'reading', 'evidence', 2, 'mcq', 'The study notes that cities with more trees have lower temperatures. Which detail best supports the claim?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('043f75bf-a14b-53ca-8640-4207986a5489', 'reading', 'tone', 2, 'mcq', 'The review calls the product disappointing and flawed. Which word best describes the tone?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('4f6ceec2-78cc-5aa7-a698-4230e56aabef', 'reading', 'purpose', 1, 'mcq', 'The flyer invites residents to a community meeting on Tuesday. What is the primary purpose of the flyer?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('c84053b1-dfc1-5e62-b09f-ad98b86ab70b', 'reading', 'structure', 2, 'mcq', 'The passage compares electric cars and gas cars. Which structure does this use?', '{"correct":"C"}'),
  ('4ea74488-592e-59f8-a798-3479b5fb831a', 'reading', 'vocabulary', 1, 'mcq', 'The plan was feasible given the budget. What does feasible mean?', '{"correct":"B"}'),
  ('5c01526b-736a-5329-86f5-3930b3ef686a', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'She packed an umbrella and checked the forecast. What can be inferred?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
  ('a667940a-04b8-5cfa-94d5-3fbca431da95', 'reading', 'comprehension', 1, 'mcq', 'Regular practice improves performance in music. Which choice best states the main idea?', '{"correct":"A"}'),
